I left out both operations requests, because neither fits this node's authority. The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. The component therefore has no file or filesystem import to append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`, and no `http-client` import to call the metadata service. Adding either would exceed the granted authority, so the world declares only the inference import. If operations needs them, the node's `with` clause has to be widened at the graph level first.

